<h2 id="faq" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#faq">#</a> FAQ</h2>
<h3 id="general-questions" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#general-questions">#</a> General Questions</h3>
<p><strong>Is MarkoPress really free?</strong></p>
<p>Yes! The Free plan is free forever for personal projects. You can build unlimited pages and posts with all core features.</p>
<p><strong>Can I switch plans later?</strong></p>
<p>Absolutely! You can upgrade or downgrade your plan at any time. When upgrading, you’ll only be charged the prorated difference.</p>
<p><strong>What payment methods do you accept?</strong></p>
<p>We accept all major credit cards (Visa, MasterCard, American Express) and PayPal. For Enterprise plans, we also support wire transfers and invoices.</p>
<h3 id="features" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#features">#</a> Features</h3>
<p><strong>Do I need coding skills?</strong></p>
<p>Not necessarily! If you can write markdown, you can use MarkoPress. However, custom themes and plugins do require HTML/CSS/JavaScript knowledge.</p>
<p><strong>Can I use my own domain?</strong></p>
<p>Custom domains are available on Pro and Enterprise plans. We provide step-by-step guides for connecting your domain.</p>
<p><strong>Is there a limit on traffic or bandwidth?</strong></p>
<p>No! We don’t limit traffic or bandwidth on any plan. Your site can handle as much traffic as it gets.</p>
<p><strong>Can I export my content?</strong></p>
<p>Yes! Your content is yours. You can export all your pages and posts as markdown files anytime.</p>
<h3 id="support" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#support">#</a> Support</h3>
<p><strong>What kind of support do you offer?</strong></p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Free:</strong> Community support (Discord, GitHub Issues)</li>
<li><strong>Pro:</strong> Email support with 24-hour response time</li>
<li><strong>Enterprise:</strong> 24/7 phone support with dedicated success manager</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Do you offer refunds?</strong></p>
<p>Yes! We offer a 14-day money-back guarantee for Pro plans. If you’re not satisfied, contact us for a full refund.</p>
<p><strong>Do you provide training?</strong></p>
<p>Training is included with Enterprise plans. For Pro and Free plans, check out our comprehensive documentation and community resources.</p>
<h3 id="technical" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#technical">#</a> Technical</h3>
<p><strong>What hosting platforms do you support?</strong></p>
<p>MarkoPress works with any static hosting service:</p>
<ul>
<li>Vercel</li>
<li>Netlify</li>
<li>GitHub Pages</li>
<li>GitLab Pages</li>
<li>AWS S3 + CloudFront</li>
<li>And many more!</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Can I self-host?</strong></p>
<p>Yes! Self-hosting is available on Enterprise plans with on-premise deployment options.</p>
<p><strong>Do I need a server?</strong></p>
<p>No! MarkoPress builds static files that can be hosted anywhere. No server required.</p>
<h3 id="security" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#security">#</a> Security</h3>
<p><strong>Is my data secure?</strong></p>
<p>Absolutely. All sites are built as static files, making them inherently secure. Enterprise plans include additional security features like SSO and advanced access controls.</p>
<p><strong>Do you backup my content?</strong></p>
<p>Your content is stored in your Git repository, so you have full control over backups. We recommend using your Git provider’s backup features.</p>
<p><strong>What about GDPR?</strong></p>
<p>MarkoPress is GDPR compliant. We don’t track users or collect personal data. You have full control over any analytics you integrate.</p>
